[=#intro]
== Introduction ==

The [../classes/html/classprotocolentry.html protocolentry class] provides methods for retrieving network protocol definitions.  These are usually defined in a file like /etc/protocols on unix-like systems or C:\Windows\System32\drivers\etc\protocol on Windows, or are served from another source via the name-service switch.

Protocols can be looked up by name or number.


[=#name]
== Lookup By Name ==

This example retrieves network protocol information for the "tcp" protocol.

